---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeAssetMetadata
---@field idDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the numeric ID of the asset. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field counterCustomEvents? gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeCustomEventList List of counter events configured for the asset. This is a read-only, auto-generated field and only applicable to a rich media asset.
