---Creative Assignment.
---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeAssignment
---@field companionCreativeOverrides? gcp.dfareporting_v5.CompanionClickThroughOverrideList Companion creative overrides for this creative assignment. Applicable to video ads.
---@field creativeIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the creative. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field sslCompliant? boolean Whether the creative to be assigned is SSL-compliant. This is a read-only field that is auto-generated when the ad is inserted or updated.
---@field clickThroughUrl? gcp.dfareporting_v5.ClickThroughUrl Click-through URL of the creative assignment.
---@field creativeGroupAssignments? gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeGroupAssignmentList Creative group assignments for this creative assignment. Only one assignment per creative group number is allowed for a maximum of two assignments.
---@field applyEventTags? boolean Whether applicable event tags should fire when this creative assignment is rendered. If this value is unset when the ad is inserted or updated, it will default to true for all creative types EXCEPT for INTERNAL_REDIRECT, INTERSTITIAL_INTERNAL_REDIRECT, and INSTREAM_VIDEO.
---@field richMediaExitOverrides? gcp.dfareporting_v5.RichMediaExitOverrideList Rich media exit overrides for this creative assignment. Applicable when the creative type is any of the following: - DISPLAY - RICH_MEDIA_INPAGE - RICH_MEDIA_INPAGE_FLOATING - RICH_MEDIA_IM_EXPAND - RICH_MEDIA_EXPANDING - RICH_MEDIA_INTERSTITIAL_FLOAT - RICH_MEDIA_MOBILE_IN_APP - RICH_MEDIA_MULTI_FLOATING - RICH_MEDIA_PEEL_DOWN - VPAID_LINEAR - VPAID_NON_LINEAR
---@field startTime? string
---@field active? boolean Whether this creative assignment is active. When true, the creative will be included in the ad's rotation.
---@field creativeId? string ID of the creative to be assigned. This is a required field.
---@field endTime? string
---@field weight? number Weight of the creative assignment, applicable when the rotation type is CREATIVE_ROTATION_TYPE_RANDOM. Value must be greater than or equal to 1.
---@field sequence? number Sequence number of the creative assignment, applicable when the rotation type is CREATIVE_ROTATION_TYPE_SEQUENTIAL. Acceptable values are 1 to 65535, inclusive.

---@alias gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeAssignmentList gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeAssignment[]

