---Click-through URL
---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeClickThroughUrl
---@field computedClickThroughUrl? string Read-only convenience field representing the actual URL that will be used for this click-through. The URL is computed as follows: - If landingPageId is specified then that landing page's URL is assigned to this field. - Otherwise, the customClickThroughUrl is assigned to this field.
