---Creative Custom Event.
---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeCustomEvent
---@field id? string ID of this event. This is a required field and should not be modified after insertion.
---@field targetType? gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeCustomEventTargetTypeEnum|string Target type used by the event.
