---@field enabledByDefault? boolean Whether this event tag should be automatically enabled for all of the advertiser's campaigns and ads.
---@field url? string Payload URL for this event tag. The URL on a click-through event tag should have a landing page URL appended to the end of it. This field is required on insertion.
