---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.InsertAdsRequest
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#ad".
---@field remarketingListExpression? gcp.dfareporting_v5.ListTargetingExpression Remarketing list targeting expression for this ad. This field must be left blank if the ad is using a targeting template. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD.
---@field sslRequired? boolean Whether this ad requires ssl. This is a read-only field that is auto-generated when the ad is inserted or updated.
---@field campaignId? string Campaign ID of this ad. This is a required field on insertion.
---@field idDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of this ad. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field active? boolean Whether this ad is active. When true, archived must be false.
---@field technologyTargeting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.TechnologyTargeting Technology platform targeting information for this ad. This field must be left blank if the ad is using a targeting template. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD.
---@field contextualKeywordTargeting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.ContextualKeywordTargeting Optional. Contextual keyword targeting information for this ad.
---@field advertiserId? string Advertiser ID of this ad. This is a required field on insertion.
---@field dynamicClickTracker? boolean Whether this ad is a dynamic click tracker. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_CLICK_TRACKER. This is a required field on insert, and is read-only after insert.
---@field dayPartTargeting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DayPartTargeting Time and day targeting information for this ad. This field must be left blank if the ad is using a targeting template. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD.
---@field geoTargeting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.GeoTargeting Geographical targeting information for this ad. This field must be left blank if the ad is using a targeting template. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD.
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this ad. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field compatibility? gcp.dfareporting_v5.AdCompatibilityEnum|string Compatibility of this ad. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_DEFAULT_AD. DISPLAY and DISPLAY_INTERSTITIAL refer to either rendering on desktop or on mobile devices or in mobile apps for regular or interstitial ads, respectively. APP and APP_INTERSTITIAL are only used for existing default ads. New mobile placements must be assigned DISPLAY or DISPLAY_INTERSTITIAL and default ads created for those placements will be limited to those compatibility types. IN_STREAM_VIDEO refers to rendering in-stream video ads developed with the VAST standard.
---@field sslCompliant? boolean Whether this ad is ssl compliant. This is a read-only field that is auto-generated when the ad is inserted or updated.
---@field endTime? string
---@field deliverySchedule? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DeliverySchedule Delivery schedule information for this ad. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD or AD_SERVING_TRACKING. This field along with subfields priority and impressionRatio are required on insertion when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD.
---@field creativeRotation? gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeRotation Creative rotation for this ad. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_DEFAULT_AD, AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD, or AD_SERVING_TRACKING. When type is AD_SERVING_DEFAULT_AD, this field should have exactly one creativeAssignment .
---@field audienceSegmentId? string Audience segment ID that is being targeted for this ad. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD.
---@field clickThroughUrlSuffixProperties? gcp.dfareporting_v5.ClickThroughUrlSuffixProperties Click-through URL suffix properties for this ad. Applies to the URL in the ad or (if overriding ad properties) the URL in the creative.
---@field lastModifiedInfo? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LastModifiedInfo Information about the most recent modification of this ad. This is a read-only field.
---@field startTime? string
---@field placementAssignments? gcp.dfareporting_v5.PlacementAssignmentList Placement assignments for this ad.
---@field campaignIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the campaign. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field archived? boolean Whether this ad is archived. When true, active must be false.
---@field type? gcp.dfareporting_v5.AdTypeEnum|string Type of ad. This is a required field on insertion. Note that default ads ( AD_SERVING_DEFAULT_AD) cannot be created directly (see Creative resource).
---@field targetingTemplateId? string Targeting template ID, used to apply preconfigured targeting information to this ad. This cannot be set while any of dayPartTargeting, geoTargeting, keyValueTargetingExpression, languageTargeting, remarketingListExpression, or technologyTargeting are set. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD.
---@field clickThroughUrl? gcp.dfareporting_v5.ClickThroughUrl Click-through URL for this ad. This is a required field on insertion. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_CLICK_TRACKER.
---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the advertiser. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field id? string ID of this ad. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field defaultClickThroughEventTagProperties? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DefaultClickThroughEventTagProperties Default click-through event tag properties for this ad.
---@field creativeGroupAssignments? gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeGroupAssignmentList Creative group assignments for this ad. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_CLICK_TRACKER. Only one assignment per creative group number is allowed for a maximum of two assignments.
---@field name? string Name of this ad. This is a required field and must be less than 256 characters long.
---@field keyValueTargetingExpression? gcp.dfareporting_v5.KeyValueTargetingExpression Key-value targeting information for this ad. This field must be left blank if the ad is using a targeting template. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD.
---@field eventTagOverrides? gcp.dfareporting_v5.EventTagOverrideList Event tag overrides for this ad.
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this ad. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field size? gcp.dfareporting_v5.Size Size of this ad. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_DEFAULT_AD.
---@field languageTargeting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LanguageTargeting Language targeting information for this ad. This field must be left blank if the ad is using a targeting template. Applicable when type is AD_SERVING_STANDARD_AD.
---@field createInfo? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LastModifiedInfo Information about the creation of this ad. This is a read-only field.
---@field comments? string Comments for this ad.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.

