---@field dynamicFeed? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DynamicFeed Required. Dynamic feed to insert.
---@field dynamicProfileId? string Required. Dynamic profile ID of the inserted dynamic feed.

---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.InsertDynamicProfilesRequest
---@field createInfo? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LastModifiedInfo Output only. The creation timestamp of the dynamic profile. This is a read-only field.
