---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.InsertEventTagsRequest
---@field advertiserId? string Advertiser ID of this event tag. This field or the campaignId field is required on insertion.
---@field name? string Name of this event tag. This is a required field and must be less than 256 characters long.
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this event tag. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field excludeFromAdxRequests? boolean Whether to remove this event tag from ads that are trafficked through Display & Video 360 to Ad Exchange. This may be useful if the event tag uses a pixel that is unapproved for Ad Exchange bids on one or more networks, such as the Google Display Network.
---@field campaignId? string Campaign ID of this event tag. This field or the advertiserId field is required on insertion.
---@field siteIds? gcp.dfareporting_v5.StringList Filter list of site IDs associated with this event tag. The siteFilterType determines whether this is a allowlist or blocklist filter.
---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the advertiser. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field campaignIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the campaign. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field enabledByDefault? boolean Whether this event tag should be automatically enabled for all of the advertiser's campaigns and ads.
---@field url? string Payload URL for this event tag. The URL on a click-through event tag should have a landing page URL appended to the end of it. This field is required on insertion.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#eventTag".
---@field urlEscapeLevels? number Number of times the landing page URL should be URL-escaped before being appended to the click-through event tag URL. Only applies to click-through event tags as specified by the event tag type.
---@field siteFilterType? gcp.dfareporting_v5.EventTagSiteFilterTypeEnum|string Site filter type for this event tag. If no type is specified then the event tag will be applied to all sites.
---@field status? gcp.dfareporting_v5.EventTagStatusEnum|string Status of this event tag. Must be ENABLED for this event tag to fire. This is a required field.
---@field type? gcp.dfareporting_v5.EventTagTypeEnum|string Event tag type. Can be used to specify whether to use a third-party pixel, a third-party JavaScript URL, or a third-party click-through URL for either impression or click tracking. This is a required field.
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this event tag. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field sslCompliant? boolean Whether this tag is SSL-compliant or not. This is a read-only field.
---@field id? string ID of this event tag. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.

---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.InsertFloodlightActivitiesRequest
---@field cacheBustingType? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityCacheBustingTypeEnum|string Code type used for cache busting in the generated tag. Applicable only when floodlightActivityGroupType is COUNTER and countingMethod is STANDARD_COUNTING or UNIQUE_COUNTING.
---@field userDefinedVariableTypes? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityUserDefinedVariableTypesItemEnumList List of the user-defined variables used by this conversion tag. These map to the "u[1-100]=" in the tags. Each of these can have a user defined type. Acceptable values are U1 to U100, inclusive.
---@field floodlightConfigurationIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the floodlight configuration. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field countingMethod? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityCountingMethodEnum|string Counting method for conversions for this floodlight activity. This is a required field.
---@field status? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityStatusEnum|string The status of the activity. This can only be set to ACTIVE or ARCHIVED_AND_DISABLED. The ARCHIVED status is no longer supported and cannot be set for Floodlight activities. The DISABLED_POLICY status indicates that a Floodlight activity is violating Google policy. Contact your account manager for more information.
---@field attributionEnabled? boolean Whether the activity is enabled for attribution.
---@field name? string Name of this floodlight activity. This is a required field. Must be less than 129 characters long and cannot contain quotes.
---@field floodlightActivityGroupId? string Floodlight activity group ID of this floodlight activity. This is a required field.
---@field floodlightTagType? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityFloodlightTagTypeEnum|string The type of Floodlight tag this activity will generate. This is a required field.
---@field idDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of this floodlight activity. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field publisherTags? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityPublisherDynamicTagList Publisher dynamic floodlight tags.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#floodlightActivity".
---@field advertiserId? string Advertiser ID of this floodlight activity. If this field is left blank, the value will be copied over either from the activity group's advertiser or the existing activity's advertiser.
---@field secure? boolean Whether this tag should use SSL.
---@field sslRequired? boolean Whether this floodlight activity must be SSL-compliant.
---@field floodlightActivityGroupTagString? string Tag string of the associated floodlight activity group. This is a read-only field.
---@field expectedUrl? string URL where this tag will be deployed. If specified, must be less than 256 characters long.
---@field notes? string General notes or implementation instructions for the tag.
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this floodlight activity. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field tagString? string Value of the cat= parameter in the floodlight tag, which the ad servers use to identify the activity. This is optional: if empty, a new tag string will be generated for you. This string must be 1 to 8 characters long, with valid characters being a-z0-9[ _ ]. This tag string must also be unique among activities of the same activity group. This field is read-only after insertion.
---@field floodlightActivityGroupType? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityFloodlightActivityGroupTypeEnum|string Type of the associated floodlight activity group. This is a read-only field.
---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the advertiser. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field id? string ID of this floodlight activity. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field floodlightConfigurationId? string Floodlight configuration ID of this floodlight activity. If this field is left blank, the value will be copied over either from the activity group's floodlight configuration or from the existing activity's floodlight configuration.
---@field defaultTags? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityDynamicTagList Dynamic floodlight tags.
---@field floodlightActivityGroupName? string Name of the associated floodlight activity group. This is a read-only field.
---@field tagFormat? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityTagFormatEnum|string Tag format type for the floodlight activity. If left blank, the tag format will default to HTML.
---@field conversionCategory? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityConversionCategoryEnum|string Required. The conversion category of the activity.
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this floodlight activity. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field sslCompliant? boolean Whether the floodlight activity is SSL-compliant. This is a read-only field, its value detected by the system from the floodlight tags.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.

---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.InsertFloodlightActivityGroupsRequest
---@field tagString? string Value of the type= parameter in the floodlight tag, which the ad servers use to identify the activity group that the activity belongs to. This is optional: if empty, a new tag string will be generated for you. This string must be 1 to 8 characters long, with valid characters being a-z0-9[ _ ]. This tag string must also be unique among activity groups of the same floodlight configuration. This field is read-only after insertion.
---@field type? gcp.dfareporting_v5.FloodlightActivityGroupTypeEnum|string Type of the floodlight activity group. This is a required field that is read-only after insertion.
---@field advertiserId? string Advertiser ID of this floodlight activity group. If this field is left blank, the value will be copied over either from the floodlight configuration's advertiser or from the existing activity group's advertiser.
---@field floodlightConfigurationId? string Floodlight configuration ID of this floodlight activity group. This is a required field.
---@field floodlightConfigurationIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the floodlight configuration. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#floodlightActivityGroup".
---@field id? string ID of this floodlight activity group. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the advertiser. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this floodlight activity group. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this floodlight activity group. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field name? string Name of this floodlight activity group. This is a required field. Must be less than 65 characters long and cannot contain quotes.
---@field idDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of this floodlight activity group. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.

---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.InsertPlacementGroupsRequest
---@field comment? string Comments for this placement group.
---@field contentCategoryId? string ID of the content category assigned to this placement group.
---@field siteIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the site. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field childPlacementIds? gcp.dfareporting_v5.StringList IDs of placements which are assigned to this placement group. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
