---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the advertiser. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field videoActiveViewOptOut? boolean Whether Verification and ActiveView are disabled for in-stream video creatives for this placement. The same setting videoActiveViewOptOut exists on the site level -- the opt out occurs if either of these settings are true. These settings are distinct from DirectorySites.settings.activeViewOptOut or Sites.siteSettings.activeViewOptOut which only apply to display ads. However, Accounts.activeViewOptOut opts out both video traffic, as well as display ads, from Verification and ActiveView.
---@field paymentSource? gcp.dfareporting_v5.PlacementPaymentSourceEnum|string Payment source for this placement. This is a required field that is read-only after insertion.
---@field siteId? string Site ID associated with this placement. On insert, you must set either this field or the directorySiteId field to specify the site associated with this placement. This is a required field that is read-only after insertion.
---@field keyName? string Key name of this placement. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field id? string ID of this placement. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field additionalSizes? gcp.dfareporting_v5.SizeList Additional sizes associated with this placement. When inserting or updating a placement, only the size ID field is used.
---@field contentCategoryId? string ID of the content category assigned to this placement.
---@field placementStrategyId? string ID of the placement strategy assigned to this placement.
---@field paymentApproved? boolean Whether payment was approved for this placement. This is a read-only field relevant only to publisher-paid placements.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.

