---Contains information about a single invoice
---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.Invoice
---@field invoiceType? gcp.dfareporting_v5.InvoiceInvoiceTypeEnum The type of invoice document.
---@field campaign_summaries? gcp.dfareporting_v5.CampaignSummaryList The list of summarized campaign information associated with this invoice.
---@field serviceStartDate? string The invoice service start date.
---@field pdfUrl? string The URL to download a PDF copy of the invoice. Note that this URL is user specific and requires a valid OAuth 2.0 access token to access. The access token must be provided in an *Authorization: Bearer* HTTP header. The URL will only be usable for 7 days from when the api is called.
---@field issueDate? string The date when the invoice was issued.
---@field id? string ID of this invoice.
---@field paymentsAccountId? string The ID of the payments account the invoice belongs to. Appears on the invoice PDF as *Billing Account Number*.
---@field currencyCode? string Invoice currency code in ISO 4217 format.
---@field totalTaxAmountMicros? string The sum of all taxes in invoice, in micros of the invoice's currency.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#invoice".
---@field totalAmountMicros? string The invoice total amount, in micros of the invoice's currency.
---@field replacedInvoiceIds? gcp.dfareporting_v5.StringList The originally issued invoice(s) that is being cancelled by this invoice, if applicable. May appear on invoice PDF as *Replaced invoice numbers*. Note: There may be multiple replaced invoices due to consolidation of multiple invoices into a single invoice.
---@field paymentsProfileId? string The ID of the payments profile the invoice belongs to. Appears on the invoice PDF as *Billing ID*.
---@field dueDate? string The invoice due date.
---@field serviceEndDate? string The invoice service end date.
---@field purchaseOrderNumber? string Purchase order number associated with the invoice.
---@field correctedInvoiceId? string The originally issued invoice that is being adjusted by this invoice, if applicable. May appear on invoice PDF as *Reference invoice number*.
---@field subtotalAmountMicros? string The pre-tax subtotal amount, in micros of the invoice's currency.

