---@field advertiserGroupId? string Advertiser group ID of the associated advertiser.
---@field idDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of this campaign. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field archived? boolean Whether this campaign has been archived.
---@field defaultClickThroughEventTagProperties? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DefaultClickThroughEventTagProperties Click-through event tag ID override properties for this campaign.
---@field measurementPartnerLink? gcp.dfareporting_v5.MeasurementPartnerCampaignLink Measurement partner campaign link for tag wrapping.
---@field eventTagOverrides? gcp.dfareporting_v5.EventTagOverrideList Overrides that can be used to activate or deactivate advertiser event tags.
---@field adBlockingConfiguration? gcp.dfareporting_v5.AdBlockingConfiguration Ad blocking settings for this campaign.
---@field defaultLandingPageId? string The default landing page ID for this campaign.
---@field clickThroughUrlSuffixProperties? gcp.dfareporting_v5.ClickThroughUrlSuffixProperties Click-through URL suffix override properties for this campaign.
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this campaign. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field comment? string Arbitrary comments about this campaign. Must be less than 256 characters long.
---@field creativeOptimizationConfiguration? gcp.dfareporting_v5.CreativeOptimizationConfiguration Creative optimization configuration for the campaign.
---@field advertiserId? string Advertiser ID of this campaign. This is a required field.
---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the advertiser ID of this campaign. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this campaign. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#campaign".
---@field lastModifiedInfo? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LastModifiedInfo Information about the most recent modification of this campaign. This is a read-only field.
---@field endDate? string
---@field startDate? string
---@field billingInvoiceCode? string Billing invoice code included in the Campaign Manager client billing invoices associated with the campaign.
---@field audienceSegmentGroups? gcp.dfareporting_v5.AudienceSegmentGroupList Audience segment groups assigned to this campaign. Cannot have more than 300 segment groups.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.
---@field id string Required. Campaign ID.

