---@field floodlightConfigurationId? string Floodlight configuration ID of this floodlight activity group. This is a required field.
---@field floodlightConfigurationIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the floodlight configuration. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#floodlightActivityGroup".
---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the advertiser. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this floodlight activity group. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this floodlight activity group. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field name? string Name of this floodlight activity group. This is a required field. Must be less than 65 characters long and cannot contain quotes.
---@field idDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of this floodlight activity group. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.
---@field id string Required. EventTag ID.

