---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.PatchPlacementGroupsRequest
---@field comment? string Comments for this placement group.
---@field contentCategoryId? string ID of the content category assigned to this placement group.
---@field siteIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the site. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field childPlacementIds? gcp.dfareporting_v5.StringList IDs of placements which are assigned to this placement group. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field primaryPlacementId? string ID of the primary placement, used to calculate the media cost of a roadblock (placement group). Modifying this field will automatically modify the primary field on all affected roadblock child placements.
---@field directorySiteIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the directory site. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this placement group. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field campaignId? string Campaign ID of this placement group. This field is required on insertion.
---@field pricingSchedule? gcp.dfareporting_v5.PricingSchedule Pricing schedule of this placement group. This field is required on insertion.
---@field directorySiteId? string Directory site ID associated with this placement group. On insert, you must set either this field or the site_id field to specify the site associated with this placement group. This is a required field that is read-only after insertion.
---@field idDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of this placement group. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field name? string Name of this placement group. This is a required field and must be less than 256 characters long.
---@field campaignIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the campaign. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field externalId? string External ID for this placement.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#placementGroup".
---@field primaryPlacementIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the primary placement. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field createInfo? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LastModifiedInfo Information about the creation of this placement group. This is a read-only field.
---@field advertiserId? string Advertiser ID of this placement group. This is a required field on insertion.
---@field activeStatus? gcp.dfareporting_v5.PlacementGroupActiveStatusEnum|string Whether this placement group is active, inactive, archived or permanently archived.
---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the advertiser. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this placement group. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field siteId? string Site ID associated with this placement group. On insert, you must set either this field or the directorySiteId field to specify the site associated with this placement group. This is a required field that is read-only after insertion.
---@field lastModifiedInfo? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LastModifiedInfo Information about the most recent modification of this placement group. This is a read-only field.
---@field placementGroupType? gcp.dfareporting_v5.PlacementGroupPlacementGroupTypeEnum|string Type of this placement group. A package is a simple group of placements that acts as a single pricing point for a group of tags. A roadblock is a group of placements that not only acts as a single pricing point, but also assumes that all the tags in it will be served at the same time. A roadblock requires one of its assigned placements to be marked as primary for reporting. This field is required on insertion.
---@field placementStrategyId? string ID of the placement strategy assigned to this placement group.
---@field id string Required. Placement ID.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.

---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.PatchPlacementStrategiesRequest
