---@field name? string Name of this placement strategy. This is a required field. It must be less than 256 characters long and unique among placement strategies of the same account.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#placementStrategy".
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.
