---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.PatchPlacementsRequest
---@field comment? string Comments for this placement.
---@field campaignIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the campaign. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field advertiserId? string Advertiser ID of this placement. This field can be left blank.
---@field lookbackConfiguration? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LookbackConfiguration Lookback window settings for this placement.
---@field publisherUpdateInfo? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LastModifiedInfo Information about the last publisher update. This is a read-only field.
---@field allowOnYoutube? boolean Optional. Whether the placement is enabled for YouTube integration.
---@field idDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of this placement. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field adServingPlatformId? string Optional. Ad serving platform ID to identify the ad serving platform used by the placement. Measurement partners can use this field to add ad-server specific macros. Possible values are: * `1`, Adelphic * `2`, Adform * `3`, Adobe * `4`, Amobee * `5`, Basis (Centro) * `6`, Beeswax * `7`, Amazon * `8`, DV360 (DBM) * `9`, Innovid * `10`, MediaMath * `11`, Roku OneView DSP * `12`, TabMo Hawk * `13`, The Trade Desk * `14`, Xandr Invest DSP * `15`, Yahoo DSP * `16`, Zeta Global * `17`, Scaleout * `18`, Bidtellect * `19`, Unicorn * `20`, Teads * `21`, Quantcast * `22`, Cognitiv * `23`, AdTheorent * `24`, DeepIntent * `25`, Pulsepoint
---@field tagFormats? gcp.dfareporting_v5.PlacementTagFormatsItemEnumList Tag formats to generate for this placement. This field is required on insertion. Acceptable values are: - "PLACEMENT_TAG_STANDARD" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_IFRAME_JAVASCRIPT" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_IFRAME_ILAYER" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_INTERNAL_REDIRECT" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_JAVASCRIPT" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_INTERSTITIAL_IFRAME_JAVASCRIPT" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_INTERSTITIAL_INTERNAL_REDIRECT" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_INTERSTITIAL_JAVASCRIPT" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_CLICK_COMMANDS" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_INSTREAM_VIDEO_PREFETCH" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_INSTREAM_VIDEO_PREFETCH_VAST_3" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_INSTREAM_VIDEO_PREFETCH_VAST_4" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_TRACKING" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_TRACKING_IFRAME" - "PLACEMENT_TAG_TRACKING_JAVASCRIPT"
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this placement. This field can be left blank.
---@field youtubeSettings? gcp.dfareporting_v5.YoutubeSettings Optional. YouTube settings for the placement. The placement must be enabled for YouTube to use this field.
---@field placementGroupIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the placement group. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field tagSetting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.TagSetting Tag settings for this placement.
---@field siteServed? boolean Optional. Whether the ads in the placement are served by another platform and CM is only used for tracking or they are served by CM. A false value indicates the ad is served by CM.
---@field pricingSchedule? gcp.dfareporting_v5.PricingSchedule Pricing schedule of this placement. This field is required on insertion, specifically subfields startDate, endDate and pricingType.
---@field createInfo? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LastModifiedInfo Information about the creation of this placement. This is a read-only field.
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this placement. This field can be left blank.
---@field directorySiteIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the directory site. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field directorySiteId? string Directory site ID of this placement. On insert, you must set either this field or the siteId field to specify the site associated with this placement. This is a required field that is read-only after insertion.
---@field activeStatus? gcp.dfareporting_v5.PlacementActiveStatusEnum|string Whether this placement is active, inactive, archived or permanently archived.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#placement".
---@field siteIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the site. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field placementGroupId? string ID of this placement's group, if applicable.
---@field externalId? string External ID for this placement.
---@field wrappingOptOut? boolean Whether this placement opts out of tag wrapping.
---@field primary? boolean Whether this placement is the primary placement of a roadblock (placement group). You cannot change this field from true to false. Setting this field to true will automatically set the primary field on the original primary placement of the roadblock to false, and it will automatically set the roadblock's primaryPlacementId field to the ID of this placement.
---@field adBlockingOptOut? boolean Whether this placement opts out of ad blocking. When true, ad blocking is disabled for this placement. When false, the campaign and site settings take effect.
