---@field keyName? string Key name of this placement. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field additionalSizes? gcp.dfareporting_v5.SizeList Additional sizes associated with this placement. When inserting or updating a placement, only the size ID field is used.
---@field contentCategoryId? string ID of the content category assigned to this placement.
---@field placementStrategyId? string ID of the placement strategy assigned to this placement.
---@field paymentApproved? boolean Whether payment was approved for this placement. This is a read-only field relevant only to publisher-paid placements.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.
---@field id string Required. Placement ID.

