---Contains properties of a site.
---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.Site
---@field videoSettings? gcp.dfareporting_v5.SiteVideoSettings Default video settings for new placements created under this site. This value will be used to populate the placements.videoSettings field, when no value is specified for the new placement.
---@field id? string ID of this site. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field name? string Name of this site.This is a required field. Must be less than 128 characters long. If this site is under a subaccount, the name must be unique among sites of the same subaccount. Otherwise, this site is a top-level site, and the name must be unique among top-level sites of the same account.
---@field adServingPlatformId? string Optional. Ad serving platform ID to identify the ad serving platform used by the site. Measurement partners can use this field to add ad-server specific macros. If set, this value acts as the default during placement creation. Possible values are: * `1`, Adelphic * `2`, Adform * `3`, Adobe * `4`, Amobee * `5`, Basis (Centro) * `6`, Beeswax * `7`, Amazon * `8`, DV360 (DBM) * `9`, Innovid * `10`, MediaMath * `11`, Roku OneView DSP * `12`, TabMo Hawk * `13`, The Trade Desk * `14`, Xandr Invest DSP * `15`, Yahoo DSP * `16`, Zeta Global * `17`, Scaleout * `18`, Bidtellect * `19`, Unicorn * `20`, Teads * `21`, Quantcast * `22`, Cognitiv * `23`, AdTheorent * `24`, DeepIntent * `25`, Pulsepoint
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this site. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#site".
---@field directorySiteIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the directory site. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field siteSettings? gcp.dfareporting_v5.SiteSettings Site-wide settings.
---@field approved? boolean Whether this site is approved.
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this site. This is a read-only field that can be left blank.
---@field directorySiteId? string Directory site associated with this site. This is a required field that is read-only after insertion.
---@field idDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of this site. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field siteContacts? gcp.dfareporting_v5.SiteContactList Site contacts.
---@field keyName? string Key name of this site. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.

