---@alias gcp.dfareporting_v5.TagSettingKeywordOptionEnum "PLACEHOLDER_WITH_LIST_OF_KEYWORDS"|"IGNORE"|"GENERATE_SEPARATE_TAG_FOR_EACH_KEYWORD"

---Dynamic and Image Tag Settings.
---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.TagSettings
