---@alias gcp.dfareporting_v5.TargetWindowTargetWindowOptionEnum "NEW_WINDOW"|"CURRENT_WINDOW"|"CUSTOM"

---Contains properties of a targetable remarketing list. Remarketing enables you to create lists of users who have performed specific actions on a site, then target ads to members of those lists. This resource is a read-only view of a remarketing list to be used to facilitate targeting ads to specific lists. Remarketing lists that are owned by your advertisers and those that are shared to your advertisers or account are accessible via this resource. To manage remarketing lists that are owned by your advertisers, use the RemarketingLists resource.
---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.TargetableRemarketingList
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this remarketing list. This is a read-only, auto-generated field that is only returned in GET requests.
---@field accountId? string Account ID of this remarketing list. This is a read-only, auto-generated field that is only returned in GET requests.
---@field listSource? gcp.dfareporting_v5.TargetableRemarketingListListSourceEnum Product from which this targetable remarketing list was originated.
---@field lifeSpan? string Number of days that a user should remain in the targetable remarketing list without an impression.
---@field active? boolean Whether this targetable remarketing list is active.
---@field description? string Targetable remarketing list description.
---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the advertiser.
---@field name? string Name of the targetable remarketing list. Is no greater than 128 characters long.
---@field listSize? string Number of users currently in the list. This is a read-only field.
---@field id? string Targetable remarketing list ID.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#targetableRemarketingList".
---@field advertiserId? string Dimension value for the advertiser ID that owns this targetable remarketing list.

---@alias gcp.dfareporting_v5.TargetableRemarketingListList gcp.dfareporting_v5.TargetableRemarketingList[]

---@alias gcp.dfareporting_v5.TargetableRemarketingListListSourceEnum "REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_OTHER"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_ADX"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_DFP"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_XFP"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_DFA"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_GA"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_YOUTUBE"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_DBM"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_GPLUS"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_DMP"|"REMARKETING_LIST_SOURCE_PLAY_STORE"

---Targetable remarketing list response
