---@field languageTargeting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.LanguageTargeting Language targeting criteria.
---@field id? string ID of this targeting template. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field advertiserId? string Advertiser ID of this targeting template. This is a required field on insert and is read-only after insert.
---@field contextualKeywordTargeting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.ContextualKeywordTargeting Optional. Contextual keyword targeting criteria.
---@field geoTargeting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.GeoTargeting Geographical targeting criteria.
---@field name? string Name of this targeting template. This field is required. It must be less than 256 characters long and unique within an advertiser.
---@field technologyTargeting? gcp.dfareporting_v5.TechnologyTargeting Technology platform targeting criteria.
---@field subaccountId? string Subaccount ID of this targeting template. This field, if left unset, will be auto-generated on insert and is read-only after insert.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#targetingTemplate".
---@field advertiserIdDimensionValue? gcp.dfareporting_v5.DimensionValue Dimension value for the ID of the advertiser. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.

