---@class gcp.dfareporting_v5.TargetingTemplatesListResponse
---@field nextPageToken? string Pagination token to be used for the next list operation.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#targetingTemplatesListResponse".
