---@field purchaseOrder? string Purchase order (PO) for this billing profile. This PO number is used in the invoices for all of the advertisers in this billing profile.
---@field isDefault? boolean True if the billing profile is the account default profile. This is a read-only field.
---@field kind? string Identifies what kind of resource this is. Value: the fixed string "dfareporting#billingProfile".
---@field currencyCode? string Billing currency code in ISO 4217 format.This is a read-only field.
---@field countryCode? string Country code of this billing profile.This is a read-only field.
---@field id? string ID of this billing profile. This is a read-only, auto-generated field.
---@field paymentsCustomerId? string The ID of the payment customer the billing profile belongs to. This is a read-only field.
---@field consolidatedInvoice? boolean Consolidated invoice option for this billing profile. Used to get a single, consolidated invoice across the chosen invoice level.
---@field status? gcp.dfareporting_v5.BillingProfileStatusEnum|string Status of this billing profile.This is a read-only field.
---@field name? string Name of this billing profile. This is a required field and must be less than 256 characters long and must be unique among billing profile in the same account.
---@field paymentsAccountId? string The ID of the payment account the billing profile belongs to. This is a read-only field.
---@field invoiceLevel? gcp.dfareporting_v5.BillingProfileInvoiceLevelEnum|string Invoice level for this billing profile. Used to group fees into separate invoices by account, advertiser, or campaign.
---@field profileId string User profile ID associated with this request.

