---@field contentCategoryId? string ID of the content category assigned to this placement.
---@field placementStrategyId? string ID of the placement strategy assigned to this placement.
---@field paymentApproved? boolean Whether payment was approved for this placement. This is a read-only field relevant only to publisher-paid placements.
